----
db error: ERROR: permission denied
DETAIL: The current user must have the ADMIN option on role "soc_plain".


connection c_admin user=soc_admin password=soc_pw
statement error
COMMENT ON ROLE soc_super IS 'a superuser';
----
db error: ERROR: permission denied
DETAIL: The current user must have the SUPERUSER attribute.


